[{"id":3054967258,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc62Fxna","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"Tested this on VSCode:\n\n- `[br]` behaves strange, I have to use `[br][br]` to get a visible difference. Inserting new lines between code blocks doesn't work at all. Looking at the markdown: `\\n` is not a valid strategy for this. Markdown requires either a trailing `\\` or two trailing spaces to insert a new line. Using two [br] probably works because markdown treats it as different paragraphs. Using `\\` seems to be our best option since it allows inserting more than one new line:\n\\\n\\\nTwo new lines does not work with trailing spaces. So using `\\n\\\\` seems to be the way to go.\n- `[lb]Sprite2D[rb]` does not work correctly yet.\n- Underline is translated to strong emphasis (bold). I thinks that's a good approach given that markdown only has emphasis levels.\n- `[url]` does not work correctly, it seems the `[class_name]` transformation is applied afterwards, so the display text of the markdown link gets converted to inline code\n- Only showing gdscript for fenced Codeblocks is good, but if a sample is only available in C# we should fallback to it instead of showing no code at all. (Although this is not a blocker, given that the builtin tooltip doesn't fallback as well).\n\nIt would also be nice to add a basic test for `marked_documentation` to the LSP test suite. Not a requirement though.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108497#pullrequestreview-3054967258","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108497","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-25T11:18:00Z"},{"id":3080973647,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc63o-1P","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12694995?u=e4abd5fa8b74c82c57955f490da199a1ac7b9d8c&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanLovato","id":12694995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk0OTk1","login":"NathanLovato","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108497#pullrequestreview-3080973647","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108497","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-08-02T09:36:08Z"},{"id":3080974391,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc63o_A3","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12694995?u=e4abd5fa8b74c82c57955f490da199a1ac7b9d8c&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanLovato","id":12694995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk0OTk1","login":"NathanLovato","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108497#pullrequestreview-3080974391","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108497","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-08-02T09:39:52Z"},{"id":3080999228,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc63pFE8","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00: